From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Tim Denk <tim.denk@zymtrace.com>
Date: Tue, 3 Nov 2026 12:27:10 +0100
Subject: [PATCH] spawn muffin processes without the exec error pipe

The muffin kernel has no pipe syscall. Command::spawn forks and execs with
inherited stdio, and an exec failure surfaces as exit code 127.

diff --git a/library/std/src/sys/process/unix/common.rs b/library/std/src/sys/process/unix/common.rs
index 8215b19..c00b5f9 100644
